# Cheering Crowd: at the beginning of EACH player's first main phase, THAT player may put a +1/+1 counter on it and, if they do, add {C} for each counter on it
# (CR 505.1a, 122.1). Bot2 accepts on turn 2: one counter, {C} - spent on its own Sol Ring (cost {1}), so the mana was Bot2's. Bot1 accepts on turn 3: two counters,
# {C}{C} - paying for both of Bot1's Sol Rings, so the count is of the counters on it, not a fixed amount.

